<!-- Material Symbols "format_underlined", for the rich text toolbar. AnkiDroid's own
     ic_format_*_black_24dp are the older Material Icons and stay as they are:
     they belong to the HTML toolbar, and replacing them would edit a file
     upstream still owns. The source viewBox runs from -960 to 0 on the y axis,
     which a vector drawable cannot express, so the group shifts it back. -->
